  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "In a medium saucepan, combine quinoa and water; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to a simmer, cover, and cook for 15 minutes. Remove from heat and let stand, covered, for 5 minutes."
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, in a small bowl, combine oil, vinegar, maple syrup, Dijon, salt, and pepper; whisk to combine the dressing."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry the fresh produce. (Skip the spinach if it came pre-washed.)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Quarter oranges; peel and slice the quarters into wedges."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide the quinoa and spinach between plates or bowls; top with orange wedges, blueberries, and sliced almonds. Drizzle with dressing and enjoy!"
    }
  ]
